ery/crawler_agent.py WorkdayAdapter — playwright\n   478→          async, {tenant}.wd1.myworkdayjobs.com/{board}\n   479→      - id: discover-agent.scorer.relevance\n   480→        scope: backend/agents/discovery/relevance_scorer.py — 6-dimension weighted\n   481→          scoring + is_hot threshold\n   482→      - id: discover-agent.digest.builder\n   483→        scope: backend/agents/discovery/digest_builder.py — compile DailyDigest from\n   484→          scored jobs\n   485→      - id: discover-agent.orchestrator\n   486→        scope: backend/agents/discovery/orchestrator.py — DiscoveryOrchestrator.run\n   487→          wires all 5 sub-agents + CrawlRun state + agent.status.discovery\n   488→          pub/sub\n   489→      - id: discover-agent.pubsub\n   490→        scope: backend/agents/discovery/orchestrator.py _publish_status helper — emit\n   491→          events to agent.status.discovery channel per pattern from\n   492→          application/orchestrator.py\n   493→  - id: infra-agent\n   494→    scope: Docker, docker-compose, AWS ECS Fargate, Digital Dash pipeline, deploy\n   495→      scripts, Celery containers\n   496→    branch: feat/infra-agent\n   497→    blocked_by:\n   498→      - api-agent\n   499→      - frontend-agent\n   500→      - scheduler-agent\n   501→    blocks: []\n   502→    capabilities:\n   503→      - docker\n   504→      - ecs\n   505→      - ecr\n   506→      - alb\n   507→      - digital-dash\n   508→      - celery\n   509→    sub_agents:\n   510→      - id: infra-agent.docker.backend\n   511→        scope: backend/Dockerfile — python:3.12-slim, requirements caching, non-root\n   512→          user\n   513→        artifact: deploy/Dockerfile.backend\n   514→      - id: infra-agent.docker.frontend\n   515→        scope: frontend/Dockerfile — node build stage + nginx serve stage\n   516→        artifact: deploy/Dockerfile.frontend\n   517→      - id: infra-agent.docker.compose\n   518→        scope: docker-compose.yml — postgres + redis + backend + frontend +\n   519→          celery-worker + celery-beat with healthchecks\n   520→        artifact: docker-compose.yml\n   521→      - id: infra-agent.ecs.task-defs\n   522→        scope: deploy/ecs-task-def-backend.json + ecs-task-def-frontend.json +\n   523→          ecs-task-def-celery-worker.json + ecs-task-def-celery-beat.json\n   524→        artifact: deploy/ecs-task-def-*.json\n   525→      - id: infra-agent.ecs.bootstrap\n   526→        scope: deploy/setup-aws.sh — one-time VPC, ALB, ECR, ECS cluster, RDS,\n   527→          ElastiCache + Celery IAM role\n   528→        artifact: deploy/setup-aws.sh\n   529→      - id: infra-agent.pipeline.digital-dash\n   530→        scope: digital-dash-pipeline.yml — build, test, push, deploy stages with\n   531→          approval gate + deploy-celery stage\n   532→        artifact: .github/workflows/digital-dash-pipeline.yml\n   533→  - id: scheduler-agent\n   534→    scope: \"Celery beat wiring: app factory, daily discovery task, beat schedule,\n   535→      retry policy\"\n   536→    branch: feat/scheduler-agent\n   537→    blocked_by:\n   538→      - data-agent\n   539→      - discover-agent\n   540→    blocks:\n   541→      - infra-agent\n   542→    capabilities:\n   543→      - celery\n   544→      - redis\n   545→      - asyncio\n   546→    sub_agents:\n   547→      - id: scheduler-agent.app\n   548→        scope: backend/scheduler/celery_app.py — Celery app factory reading broker URL\n   549→          from settings.redis_url\n   550→      - id: scheduler-agent.tasks\n   551→        scope: backend/scheduler/tasks.py — daily_discovery_task(candidate_id) wrapping\n   552→          async orchestrator.run\n   553→      - id: scheduler-agent.beat\n   554→        scope: backend/scheduler/beat.py — Beat schedule 07:00 America/New_York,\n   555→          iterates active candidates\n   556→      - id: scheduler-agent.retry\n   557→        scope: backend/scheduler/tasks.py — exponential backoff 60s/300s/900s,\n   558→          dead-letter to crawl_runs.error_log\n   559→  - id: api-streaming-agent\n   560→    scope: SSE event stream endpoint for real-time agent status streaming\n   561→    branch: feat/api-streaming-agent\n   562→    blocked_by:\n   563→      - api-agent\n   564→      - auth-agent\n   565→      - obs-agent\n   566→      - discover-agent\n   567→    blocks:\n   568→      - api-client-agent\n   569→    capabilities:\n   570→      - fastapi\n   571→      - sse\n   572→      - redis-pubsub\n   573→    sub_agents:\n   574→      - id: api-streaming-agent.events\n   575→        scope: backend/api/events.py — GET /events/stream?channel=... SSE endpoint\n   576→      - id: api-streaming-agent.subscriber\n   577→        scope: backend/api/events.py — Redis pub/sub subscriber with channel allowlist\n   578→      - id: api-streaming-agent.heartbeat\n   579→        scope: backend/api/events.py — :ping every 15s for connection loss detection\n   580→      - id: api-streaming-agent.backpressure\n   581→        scope: backend/api/events.py — drop >100 messages behind, emit slow_client event\n   582→  - id: api-client-agent\n   583→    scope: \"Frontend API client wiring: fetch wrapper, auth token injection, page\n   584→      data integration\"\n   585→    branch: feat/api-client-agent\n   586→    blocked_by:\n   587→      - api-agent\n   588→      - frontend-agent\n   589→      - api-streaming-agent\n   590→    blocks:\n   591→      - tests-agent\n   592→    capabilities:\n   593→      - typescript\n   594→      - fetch\n   595→      - eventsource\n   596→    sub_agents:\n   597→      - id: api-client-agent.client\n   598→        scope: frontend/src/api/client.ts — single apiClient instance, base URL from\n   599→          VITE_API_BASE_URL\n   600→      - id: api-client-agent.auth\n   601→        scope: frontend/src/api/auth.ts — requestMagicLink, verifyToken, refreshSession,\n   602→          JWT in localStorage\n   603→      - id: api-client-agent.discovery\n   604→